{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "ee0692ffa00ae235122390c5a90de1086862a726f2db620358ff8d764d4e9aec", "ja": "カエル、中学生くらいから触ってない気がするけど……\nそのくらいから、ダメになってたのかな？", "zh": "感觉从上初中左右开始，就没再碰过青蛙了……\n\n难道也是从那时候起，就变得不行了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_intro_1001_102mis", "source_sha256": "3ebf0acd2c09b3cb09e37db2c6e9025a291e4285f875b12d732153d55b3a42b4", "ja": "もしかしたら、虫とかも……？\nううっ、だとしたら、ちょっぴり悲しいような……。", "zh": "说不定连虫子之类的也……？\n呜呜，要是那样的话，总觉得有点难过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_intro_1002_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_intro_1003_p", "source_sha256": "7aab42e728ffa5d9be23e3fbe323952f15322365da3ca0be418cb6c67266b9ec", "ja": "捕まえたものの……どうしようかな。\nあ、お疲れさまです、青羽さん。", "zh": "虽然抓到了……该怎么办呢。\n啊，辛苦了，青羽小姐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_intro_1004_102mis", "source_sha256": "066feed6c7b8cab3b6bf48e07e38da66d0e9ba7c4b5cfbb5ecbeb5cf2e664f4b", "ja": "お疲れさまです、{$P$}さん。\n……あれ？　手に、何を乗せてるんですか？", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}先生。\n……咦？您手上托着什么呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_intro_1005_p", "source_sha256": "6c39c18b095fda662fea14e3d834e80dece7fbc896ff65d7a162f2209f36e58c", "ja": "劇場の中にてんとう虫が迷い込んでたのを、\n捕まえたんです。外に逃がしてやればいいんですかね。", "zh": "剧场里有只瓢虫迷路了，\n我把它抓住了。放到外面去就可以了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_intro_1006_102mis", "source_sha256": "18e7d034b1e271b81380153a0a0d4c6a020dde3f62fc8a2c3a5bc9b4c772f27c", "ja": "てんとう虫……わあ、小さくてかわいい！\nドット柄が、とってもキュートですよね♪", "zh": "瓢虫……哇，小小的，好可爱！\n圆点花纹特别俏皮呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_intro_1007_102mis", "source_sha256": "30651e9b2197a7d8b7dc72b51769e745d85316e768c54f5bc883cf4e630d1a49", "ja": "てんとう虫が平気なら、\n他の虫も、まだ大丈夫かも……？", "zh": "如果不怕瓢虫的话，\n其他虫子说不定也还能接受……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_intro_1008_102mis", "source_sha256": "613d46335b66e7c5867a3f757f4ac335ba987779c02de6ba53a84355ba674c38", "ja": "ありがとうございます、{$P$}さん！\nなんだか勇気をもらえた気がします♪", "zh": "谢谢你，{$P$}先生！\n总觉得自己好像获得了勇气呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_intro_1009_p", "source_sha256": "29847ee0c6c111284a4be2cdb349cad65ce43d31148437c2cd93b11e73eab6a3", "ja": "？　ど、どういたしまして。とりあえず、\n俺はこのてんとう虫を……。", "zh": "？不、不客气。总之，我先把这只瓢虫……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_intro_1010_102mis", "source_sha256": "1f1fa683daa9b0b229a66c1ea3546b41327cba030fa39ea1778472d8c0d1b5cb", "ja": "外に行くんですか？　ちょうど社長さんが、\n{$P$}さんのこと呼んでましたよ！", "zh": "要出去吗？正好社长\n在找{$P$}先生哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_intro_1011_p", "source_sha256": "49c10afbd67d0b0926d538708fb829c71c01b5cca2947fde3564142fb1644e37", "ja": "そうでしたか！　じゃあ事務所に\n向かいがてら、こいつも外に放してきますね！", "zh": "原来如此！那我去事务所的路上，也顺便把这家伙放到外面去吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_intro_1012_102mis", "source_sha256": "cbebb67b1df5efb0dd478822595fa0e202be0a422b2785a95d6c63649a2bae7d", "ja": "はい！　いってらっしゃ～い♪\n元気でね～！　てんとう虫～！", "zh": "好的！路上小心～♪\n要健康成长哦～！瓢虫～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_intro_1013_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_intro_1014_p", "source_sha256": "4231cd086ed9c6c5e01f032a4cc2760fcff4ebcac70e059da710c6149109666b", "ja": "お疲れさまです。社長、音無さん。\n用事があると伺ったので、来たんですけど……。", "zh": "辛苦了，社长、音无小姐。\n听说您有事找我，所以我就来了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_intro_1015_president", "source_sha256": "87707d54bcc75edd1980600d7c63971f0d789fcfa08a7785a98dc77087a07a53", "ja": "おお、よく来てくれたね！　今、資料を\n用意するよ。えーと、確かこれとこれと……。", "zh": "哦，来得正好！我现在就准备资料。呃……应该是这个、这个，还有……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_intro_1016_101kot", "source_sha256": "a75bed06bebc370a90ec21f7208c6e8c5989f8a4ffad95db5920bee1c466fd80", "ja": "お疲れさまです、{$P$}さん。お茶は\n熱いほうにしちゃいましたけど、よかったですか？", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}先生。我擅自选了热茶，您觉得可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_intro_1017_p", "source_sha256": "1f4e7df504ed19687e9637fa38a4830644a586459da5576e438a3b7e03f983c4", "ja": "ありがとうございます！\n秋めいてきて、熱いお茶が美味しいですよね。", "zh": "谢谢！天气渐渐有了秋意，热茶也变得好喝起来了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_intro_1018_101kot", "source_sha256": "f7634e14bd0ba168685281bfe156d1616d2e1f5302866a612a386836072731ab", "ja": "そうなんですよね。最近は夜なんかも、\n鈴虫が鳴くようになりましたし……。", "zh": "就是啊。最近连晚上也开始有铃虫鸣叫了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_intro_1019_p", "source_sha256": "955fe7d2ca57ee07f949291d234d3cc9b1e34307d36e6b2014af603da0feb417", "ja": "ですねぇ。……ん？　事務所の床にも虫が……\nいや、違いますね。これは……。", "zh": "是啊。……嗯？事务所的地板上也有虫子……\n不对，这个是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_intro_1020_101kot", "source_sha256": "5699f04d3970ff56a8765ec95e552ba7272f01d74c5f11d45077da2d0f3d235a", "ja": "これは、つけまつげ……ですね。虫と見間違えて\nびっくりしちゃうこと、あるんですよね～。", "zh": "这是，假睫毛……吧。看错成虫子，\n吓一跳的时候也是有的呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_intro_1021_president", "source_sha256": "b35fcac0577674592e20230713290068a620eae69f78e73d129dc00b1fc63bb7", "ja": "おお、そんなところに！　すまない、\nそのつけまつげは私が落としたものだよ。", "zh": "哦，原来在那种地方！不好意思，\n那副假睫毛是我掉的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_intro_1022_p", "source_sha256": "e0795da0f900b63c1a4a0a08b9545966275246649070adf8bdd41d78cda9386e", "ja": "えっ！？　社長が……ですか？", "zh": "诶！？社长……是您吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_intro_1023_president", "source_sha256": "23f2b7811aa76ca449e14cd9ebe82d2696d0a65c856e3790a4c30108cb0fd559", "ja": "うむ！　試供品をもらってね、見ていたんだ。\n他でもない、君に任せたい企画の資料だよ！", "zh": "嗯！我拿了份试用品，正在看呢。\n这是我想交给你负责的企划资料！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_intro_1024_p", "source_sha256": "bf4a29db4365f8c0b4ff2391617bca5e3106e428a8427f3293c5efdaf9fc85b2", "ja": "つけまつげが、資料……。\nでは、コスメ系の企画という事でしょうか？", "zh": "假睫毛，是资料……  \n那么，这是关于化妆品的企划吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_intro_1025_president", "source_sha256": "df25a19d79893d1c395b6732fd988ec7205ad2c59cbe3b2e9816445a96adb514", "ja": "そのとおりだよ、君！", "zh": "就是这样，制作人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_intro_1026_president", "source_sha256": "0e02db8f2a1ccf58bed50fa2b333f7a85a6841b0254b4c33aa840dba4f338348", "ja": "化粧品の新規ブランドを立ち上げるにあたって、\n765プロのアイドルを起用したいというオファーだ。", "zh": "这是一次为创立化妆品新品牌而发出的邀约，希望启用765名专业偶像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_intro_1027_president", "source_sha256": "84eada0614ba7a3baf3121f540e108b8b03a8f52f1386e873b6b5a80e88b2350", "ja": "メインターゲットは中高生……\nいわゆる、プチプラコスメと呼ばれるものだ！", "zh": "主要目标是初高中生……\n也就是所谓的平价彩妆！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_intro_1028_p", "source_sha256": "798488da15c4987dfe361da4dc350749ae54dffa173863c257112480000096bf", "ja": "プチプラコスメ……。\n確かに、学生を中心に人気と聞きますね。", "zh": "平价美妆……\n确实听说主要在学生中很受欢迎。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_intro_1029_101kot", "source_sha256": "a6b5fc480733af12d44f20557d914b91934dfac87ae529b1a86f1e6ecf1cea4e", "ja": "最近は、大人でも使うんですよ。\n値段の割に質が良くて、流行も押さえてますし！", "zh": "最近大人也在用呢。\n价格实惠，品质又好，还紧跟潮流！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_intro_1030_p", "source_sha256": "f0043868abd81f5e7c641580cb9c3cdedba6c616eb7a6385b0bcd3f6240c461d", "ja": "なるほど……。想像しているよりも\n幅広い層にアピールできそうですね！", "zh": "原来如此……。看来它能吸引到比我想象中更广泛的群体呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_intro_1031_president", "source_sha256": "8d307693e67bffcfd857cc3a0f432a67b1ef20baf60954fc9fbbf4f8e830a25d", "ja": "うむ！　広告も大きく展開する予定で、\n楽曲のデモがもう届いているんだ。早速聞いてみよう！", "zh": "嗯！广告也计划大规模铺开，\n歌曲的小样已经送到了。我们马上听听看吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_intro_1033_p", "source_sha256": "d8e3498e582f3dd8a08d6994bf6f244503f79c4a144d917eadbea26c8d3dd4f0", "ja": "切ない雰囲気もありつつ、\n真っ直ぐに情熱的で……ぐっときますね！", "zh": "虽然有种忧伤的氛围，却又直率而热情……真是让人心潮澎湃啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_intro_1034_101kot", "source_sha256": "7b8b43d7dd19e6ef30506009560e519defff43c0bb496988a6b199f0c4d75061", "ja": "ええ。なんだか、子どもと大人の間にいるような、\nそんなもどかしい曲調で……たまりませんね♪", "zh": "是啊。总觉得像是处在孩子与大人之间，那种令人焦躁的曲调……真让人欲罢不能呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_intro_1035_president", "source_sha256": "62db4dca7ea324f55c81977d199c1bb17609b7a6fb158f612d627c563c82fc56", "ja": "そこでだ。君には我が765プロのアイドル諸君から、\n今回の企画に適任と思われるメンバーを選んでほしい！", "zh": "那么，我希望你从我方765事务所的各位职业偶像中，选出你认为适合这次企划的成员！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_intro_1036_101kot", "source_sha256": "8ca9a8c4991e9f5662e16d08d054f76d08381c3ab66ec4ae2800b0babaa15009", "ja": "765プロにはいろんな年齢層の子がいますからね。\nきっと、ぴったりな子が見つかると思いますよ！", "zh": "毕竟765艺能里各个年龄段的孩子都有呢。\n肯定能找到合适的人选的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_intro_1037_p", "source_sha256": "d2040279d4eec8dbf42b5b4adb23b57039f83f9c4e8030c5ce0adfddb68fd5cb", "ja": "そうですね……そうなんですが……\n何かこう、フックが欲しいような……。", "zh": "是啊……虽然是这样……\n总觉得，应该要有点什么吸引人的亮点……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_intro_1038_president", "source_sha256": "4c1d972d5beee1bce886e470dc4f217d969aec9238d6ffc3c0a20d66ea5e5a7a", "ja": "うむ！　そこに気づくとは流石だね、君！\n無難な印象になるのは、やはり避けたい。", "zh": "嗯！能注意到那一点，真不愧是你啊！\n果然还是想避免留下平庸无奇的印象。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_intro_1039_president", "source_sha256": "36b5e930ca2ef001f84e3795d5a2f755843d88d5894286bc6b7b2b4874f95706", "ja": "先方からも、世間をあっと言わせるような\n斬新さが欲しいとの事だよ。", "zh": "对方也表示，希望能有让世人惊叹的创新之处。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_intro_1040_p", "source_sha256": "5a34be53cfed3bb0562b610156a999f5110caddad33d99f86a7c507d2d08ff51", "ja": "そうなると、やはりメンバー選出が大事ですね……。\nわかりました！　全力で挑みます！", "zh": "这样一来，成员的选定果然很重要呢……\n明白了！我会全力以赴！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_intro_1041_president", "source_sha256": "8c9f80d1d0930ce0cfe7e5d4ee9e3f3166aac3af3efbf0766ffaa47c87be09fb", "ja": "気合いは十分のようだね。\nよろしく頼むよ！", "zh": "看起来干劲十足呢。\n拜托你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_intro_1042_p", "source_sha256": "12d763847b5c9f7e7ed5536e90dbe57e8dcde54e3e5bc0edfb30ff0dde50555f", "ja": "（プチプラコスメ……まずは色々勉強しつつ、\n最高のメンバーを選ばないとな！）", "zh": "（平价彩妆……得先一边学习各种相关知识，一边选出最棒的成员才行！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
